  <item>
    <title>一部电影引发的胡说八道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6667fd24c26e396a36f1e0ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6667fd24c26e396a36f1e0ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Jun 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>summa H去日本学习了，这一期就文琦，大木和我三个人因为一部电影开始随便聊聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>大木和我还有神秘嘉宾将在7月初做一个昆明旅游项目，欢迎大家来耍。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;消费降级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不同价格的胶片相机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不同镜头有不同的特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;用过大画幅后是怎么看待其它画幅的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;人在照片中的位置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;喜欢的摄影师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Luigi ghirri的摄影作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Vivian Maier</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;摄影是治愈还是致郁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;艺术和摄影的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;三张图片的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大木和狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;一组拍了27年的作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;时间累积的作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不同性格与头像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不同时期喜欢的摄影作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;理想摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span>Luigi ghirr</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs14nUbkhC_c2D2wXXR3yVJEeccX.jpg"></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1P8RoDvuAIzdKFtyNMj2l1oa52.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnpcBGrEUULopI-SFcghMlkZhH8L.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1N_AWeFWV5lQ4s7Q2veQAd7nWf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Vivian</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp-TnXQ2WexVBNDHf7OsdKvh8SeO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoB3RGmuYM2HFH6IEeFGsjf9l1ff.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrgEmvW4JheVehCqtWfDzMGNvY-m.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp9NpQYi5GMHTeuKB9E_xrbuqy5p.m4a" length="77297854" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmU89aLwTbizQ7H7Ku_hsUWFYyTY.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>我们的摄影故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6646f40482b428eafd37c322</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6646f40482b428eafd37c322</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 May 2024 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们四人分享了关于摄影的故事，大家都可以在评论区分享您和摄影的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 因为一部电影去了挪威</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 想去看看真实的挪威的森林是什么样子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a> 去了一周只见到了四个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 两个男的一起出去共享浪漫时刻会尴尬吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 三脚架断在雪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 用半截三脚架拍完了挪威</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 没有缘分的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 通过创作让幻想变成一个圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> 情感都是自己想象出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> 摄影收获了爱情还是爱情收获了摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> 经历成就了现在的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 疫情期间外出拍摄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> 背相机拍照被罚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 鸣沙山上还一个落日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> INFP的共鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a> 话少是男人最好的医美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a> 拒绝窒息的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a> 革命友谊也挺好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 用摄影的方式结束一段爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 因为有了摄影有了更多的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 疫情期间的创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 零下十几度穿着短裤短袖在外面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 故事未完待续</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltaT1B2NV_ObqHW3vTiyf8V0y3do.m4a" length="49058891" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmU89aLwTbizQ7H7Ku_hsUWFYyTY.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
